worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_06.js"
  ceiling 758
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 810 to 812 for server parity (R1013): tryArithmetic records the calculator events `try_arithmetic` logs in Rust (`solverEvents`), which the JavaScript server projects into the native thinking trace. Lowered to 795 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the compounding-frequency labels left compoundLabel for the policy compound_interest block of data/seed/handler-rules.lino. Lowered to 758 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the numeric-list intros and result labels became seeded numeric_list_* responses read through NUMERIC_LIST_LOCALIZATION."
